 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/08/09 04:24| 02 | 066| 026| 0775| 0223| 0318| 1090|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/08/08 14:12| 01 | 250| 014| 0255| 0064| 0213| 0372|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/08/08 12:12| 01 | 262| 014| 0309| 0019| 0275| 0325|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/08/08 11:12| 00 | 224| 010| 0326| 0082| 0221| 0428|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/08/08 07:24| 02 | 265| 024| 0635| 0350| 0325| 1302|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/08/08 06:36| 02 | 218| 010| 031"
